: "engenn1le05ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn1le05ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Susan,<br />\nCould you do me a favor? The directors from Seattle arrive today. Could you go to the airport to welcome them? You can use the company car.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn1le05ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "Could someone order lunch for the boardroom? Please get a lot of sandwiches. Get some cookies, but not many. Thank you.<br />J Miller<br/> <br/>", "time": "12500"}, {"image": "engenn1le05ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "Mr. Miller,<br />I am happy to go to the airport. Tom can order sandwiches and cookies. He can take them to the boardroom. His e-mail is tom@acmail.com. I can copy him.<br />Susan<br/> <br/>", "time": "25500"}, {"image": "engenn1le05ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "Susan,<br />Great. Thank you for your help, Susan.<br />J Miller", "time": "44000"}], "coverimg": "engenn1le05ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"content": [], "type": "tips"}], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "When do you ask for help?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Who do you ask? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "I can ask for help.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can offer to help.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask or give permission using <span class=\"italic\">can</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "fee